        <details key="documentation" value="Summary: Returns a formatted string containing the book's title, author, and current available stock.&#xA;Algorithm: Return a String formatted as &quot;Title: [title], Author: [author], Available Copies: [stock]&quot;&#xA;Related Features: title, author, stock attributes&#xA;Related Classes: None&#xA;Input: None (operates on the current Book instance)&#xA;Output: String - formatted book information&#xA;Pre-condition: None&#xA;Post-condition: None (read-only operation)"/>
