        <details key="documentation" value="Summary: Checks if the book has at least one copy available in stock for borrowing.&#xA;Algorithm: Return true if stock > 0, otherwise return false.&#xA;Related Features: stock attribute&#xA;Related Classes: None&#xA;Input: None (operates on the current Book instance)&#xA;Output: boolean - true if stock > 0, false otherwise&#xA;Pre-condition: None&#xA;Post-condition: None (read-only operation)"/>
